  "bio": "Step into the serene world of dotwork tattoo art with the adept hands of MrLu. His skill level in creating fine line black and grey tattoos is renowned across Guangzhou, China, where he meticulously transforms skin into a canvas of intricate patterns and nuanced shades. Experience the artistry of MrLu and find his sought-after work spanning across Guangzhou, Shenzhen, Zhuhai, and Hong Kong.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: People's Republic Of China"
